WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:04.421
Welcome, Mr. Kataya.
Which girl would you like?

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.381
I'd like the most popular girl.

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.841
Sure, that's Mikoto.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.261
Hi, thanks for choosing me. I'm Mikoto.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.015
What kind of place is this?
Is this really for fortune telling?

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:15.932
INVISIBLE

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.143
Okay, go ahead, spit out your problems.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:20.228
I'm planning to commit suicide tomorrow.

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:21.354
This is heavy.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.023
I've lost very important documents.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.899
It'll be a ten-million-dollar damage
to the company.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:25.817
Too heavy.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.569
My life is like shit.

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:29.696
I don't have any friends
let alone a girlfriend.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.365
I work 20 hours a day, and as a result,
ten million dollars in debt?

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:35.035
Even with my lifetime income,
I can't repay that. What was my life?

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.786
He's so stressed out. Now I feel bad

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.663
that I thought this place was pervy.

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:40.248
-This is a fortune teller house.
-I see.

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:42.208
The documents are in your house.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.335
It can't be.
I've searched throughout the house.

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:48.423
There's a bookshelf with collectable
bottle caps of coke lined up on top of it.

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:49.924
-How do you know that?
-Very nostalgic.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:52.135
You'll find them under the bookshelf.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.888
Right, I didn't search there.
I'll go find that out.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:56.973
-Yeah, go check it out.
-She is amazing.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.976
I can't search for something
I've never seen. I kinda envy her.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:00.894
Okay, next!

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:03.521
My puppy has been missing for three days.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:06.900
Okay. Do you know a house with
liquor bottles lined up by the window?

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:08.151
They're taking care of him.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.819
-Let me ask you straight!
-So weird.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.196
Will I get married someday?

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:14.908
Your future wife is in Masvingo,
located in the southeast of Zimbabwe.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:17.869
-Mikoto, please have a break.
-Thanks!

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:19.913
I have many new clients today.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:23.083
But I'm in great condition and confident,
so I can do more.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.959
Oh man! I'll gain more popularity!

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:28.129
Don't say "Oh man." Good grief,
this is more serious than I thought.

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:30.590
Her fortune telling is too precise.

